WEBVTT

00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:02.444
cold, challenging circumstances.

00:01:02.468 --> 00:01:04.922
And if people were just trying
to be happy,

00:01:04.946 --> 00:01:06.803
the moment they would get to the top,

00:01:06.827 --> 00:01:08.952
they would say,
"This was a terrible mistake.

00:01:08.976 --> 00:01:10.357
I'll never do it again."

00:01:10.381 --> 00:01:11.498
(Laughter)

00:01:11.522 --> 00:01:15.137
"Instead, let me sit on a beach
somewhere drinking mojitos."

00:01:15.161 --> 00:01:18.835
But instead, people go down,

00:01:18.859 --> 00:01:21.177
and after they recover, they go up again.

00:01:21.756 --> 00:01:24.826
And if you think about
mountain climbing as an example,

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:26.865
it suggests all kinds of things.

00:01:27.206 --> 00:01:30.793
It suggests that we care
about reaching the end, a peak.